<h2 id="overview">Overview</h2>
<p>Aidoc is the leading AI-powered triage and analysis platform for radiology, processing over 1 million patient scans monthly across hundreds of hospitals worldwide. Since 2016, Aidoc has specialized in real-time detection of time-critical conditions that require immediate clinical intervention. The platform continuously monitors medical imaging workflows, automatically identifying acute findings like intracranial hemorrhage, pulmonary embolism, and cervical spine fractures, then instantly alerting clinical teams via mobile devices.</p>
<p>What sets Aidoc apart is its focus on "always-on" AI that works 24/7 in the background, analyzing every scan as it's acquired without requiring radiologist activation. The platform covers 11+ medical specialties with FDA-cleared algorithms, each optimized for specific life-threatening conditions. When critical findings are detected, Aidoc sends real-time push notifications to radiologists, emergency physicians, and specialists, reducing time-to-treatment for stroke, trauma, and other emergencies.</p>
<p>Deployed in major health systems and Level 1 trauma centers, Aidoc has demonstrated measurable improvements in patient outcomes through faster diagnosis and treatment initiation. The platform integrates seamlessly with PACS and radiology workflows, providing specialty-specific worklists, automated flagging, and team collaboration tools. With proven clinical validation and strong adoption in emergency and acute care settings, Aidoc represents the gold standard in AI-powered radiology triage.</p>
<h2 id="features">Key Features</h2>
<div class="features-grid">
<div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="inline-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg></div><h4>Real-Time Triage System</h4><p>Always-on AI monitors all imaging studies 24/7 without manual activation. Instant detection and notification for time-critical findings requiring urgent intervention.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-card-icon">🚨</div><h4>Critical Findings Detection</h4><p>Automated identification of life-threatening conditions including hemorrhage, stroke, PE, fractures, and more. FDA-cleared algorithms for acute pathology recognition.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 0 1 7.38 16.75 2 2 0 0 1-3.5.54l-.9-1.34a2 2 0 0 0-1.65-.88H9.87a2 2 0 0 1-1.99-2.33L8.53 12a2 2 0 0 0-.26-1.5L6.8 8.53a10 10 0 0 1 5.2-6.53z"/><circle cx="7.5" cy="10.5" r=".5"/><circle cx="18.5" cy="7.5" r=".5"/><circle cx="16.5" cy="13.5" r=".5"/></svg></div><h4>Stroke Detection (LVO)</h4><p>Large vessel occlusion detection for rapid stroke triage. Enables immediate neurology consultation and intervention for better patient outcomes.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-card-icon">🫁</div><h4>Pulmonary Embolism Detection</h4><p>Automated PE identification in CT pulmonary angiography studies. Real-time alerts enable timely anticoagulation therapy initiation.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-card-icon">💀</div><h4>Intracranial Hemorrhage Detection</h4><p>Identifies ICH including subdural, epidural, subarachnoid, and intraparenchymal hemorrhage. Critical for trauma and emergency department workflow.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="inline-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 000 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 001.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 01-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 01-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 017.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"></path></svg></div><h4>Workflow Optimization Tools</h4><p>Specialty-specific worklists prioritize urgent cases for radiologist review. Reduces time from scan acquisition to final diagnosis.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg></div><h4>Radiologist Collaboration Platform</h4><p>Team communication and case discussion tools integrated into workflow. Facilitates multidisciplinary consultation for complex cases.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="inline-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="20" rx="2" ry="2" width="14" x="5" y="2"></rect><line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="18" y2="18"></line></svg></div><h4>24/7 Mobile Monitoring</h4><p>Push notifications to smartphones and mobile devices for immediate awareness. Ensures critical findings reach clinicians anywhere, anytime.</p></div>
</div>
<h2 id="pros-cons">Pros &amp; Cons</h2>
<div class="pros-cons-grid">
<div class="pros-box"><h4><svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Advantages</h4><ul><li>Exceptional real-time triage capabilities</li><li>Multiple FDA-cleared algorithms</li><li>24/7 always-on monitoring</li><li>Proven reduction in time-to-treatment</li><li>Covers 11+ medical specialties</li><li>Mobile alert system</li><li>Seamless PACS integration</li><li>Strong clinical validation</li><li>Excellent for emergency departments</li><li>Improves patient outcomes measurably</li></ul></div>
<div class="cons-box"><h4><svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg> Disadvantages</h4><ul><li>Enterprise pricing only</li><li>Focused on acute/critical conditions</li><li>Requires robust IT infrastructure</li><li>Potential for alert fatigue</li><li>Implementation complexity</li><li>Limited to supported specialties</li><li>High initial investment</li><li>Training required for optimal use</li></ul></div>
</div>
<h2 id="pricing">Pricing Plans</h2>
<table class="pricing-table">
